msgstr "10/100 Mb/s Ethernet s IEEE 802.3af PoE"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/poe-shield.rst:22
msgid "Up to 5.67 W to the camera via 5.4 V VIN"
msgstr "Do 5,67 W kameri preko 5,4 V VIN"

